SAMPLE   Product and chain rule: f′(x) = 2 sin x cos x·cos 2x − 2sin²x·sin 2x = 2 sin x·(cos x cos 2x − sin x sin 2x) = 2 sin x·cos 3x  (cos(A + B) = cos A cos B − sin A sin B)
