SAMPLE   • sin x = 0
SAMPLE     sin x = 0
SAMPLE       ⇒ x = πn
SAMPLE       Inside the interval (n = …, −1, 0, 1, …):  x = 0
SAMPLE   • cos 3x = 0
SAMPLE     cos(3x) = 0
SAMPLE       ⇒ 3x = π/2 + πn
SAMPLE       Inside the interval (n = …, −1, 0, 1, …):  x = −π/6,  x = π/6
