SAMPLE   Differentiate f′ again:  {f″(x) = (2 + (3)/((x)^(2)))}
SAMPLE [subheading] Solve f″(x) = 0
SAMPLE   f″(x) = 2 + 3/x² = 0 has no solution: it is always positive.
SAMPLE   [result] No solutions on 0.2 < x < 3.1.
